  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.50 “Examination coordinator” means a person, designated by the division, who attends and supervises final practical examinations.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
